{"unit_id":"1byteone__dsh-plugin-nlbi#feature-1","repo":"1byteone/dsh-plugin-nlbi","commit":"232f9243029add39dd18a368de45d8326aca178f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-nlbi 的功能「自然语言查库」：用户用自然语言描述筛选、聚合或关联需求，工具调用 DSH 模型生成 SQL，经校验后执行只读查询并返回结果表格和图表建议。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:519-538","lib/index.js:1151-1160","lib/text2sql.js:493-575"]}
